## Navigation Implementation

**Module:** feature:pocket

### Routes
- PocketRoute (dashboard)
- ManagePocketRoute

### Navigation Graph
```kotlin
fun NavGraphBuilder.pocketNavGraph(
    navController: NavController
) {
    composable<PocketRoute> {
        PocketScreen(
            onNavigateBack = { navController.popBackStack() },
            onNavigateToManage = { navController.navigate(ManagePocketRoute) },
            onNavigateToAccount = { id -> navController.navigate(AccountRoute(id)) }
        )
    }
    composable<ManagePocketRoute> {
        ManagePocketScreen(...)
    }
}
```

